{"version":1,"content":"<p>朝鮮官方傳媒周六（17日）報道，軍方周四（15日）進行新型超高速魚雷系統「蠶-2.0」（Zam-2.0）的試射，並首次在魚雷的目標探測與導引功能中應用人工智能（AI）技術，宣稱測試取得成功。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T08:19:41.641855+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":95,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T07:39:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T08:17:33.607679+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T08:17:36.598765+00:00","content_hash":"c26ed5d91647a25230e85aca65aa7c8bb50aef46e985a7214b60f65e4171edbe","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}